      ],
      "source": "https://www.visitoracle.org/"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The Acadia Ranch Museum, run by the Oracle Historical Society, showcases the town’s mining and ranching heritage.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        16,
